- extract_domain [preprocess]: Extract a protein domain by UniProt/PDB residue numbering.  Writes a trimmed PDB containing only the requested residue range. Uses Bio.PDB when available, with MDAnalysis as fallback.  Example: extract kinase domain of ERBB3 (P21860) with resid 503-771 → ERBB3_kinase_domain.pdb …
    required: pdb_file, start_resid, end_resid
